      "text": "Day 3 · Breakfast, then a half-day excursion (4 hours) with an English-speaking guide to Corcovado. An open train climbs through the rainforest to the summit, at about 710 m, where the statue of Christ the Redeemer (38 m), inaugurated in 1931, overlooks a breathtaking panorama: Guanabara Bay, the Rio–Niterói Bridge, the Botanical Garden, the Maracanã Stadium and Sugar Loaf.",
